{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03164","headline":"当涂界寄裴宣州 · 张九龄","name":"当涂界寄裴宣州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人宣城守，亦在江南偏。\n如何分虎竹，相与间山川。\n章绶胡爲者，形骸非自然。\n含情津渡阔，倚望脰空延。\n远近闻佳政，平生仰大贤。\n推心徒有属，会面良无缘。\n日夕遵前渚，江村投暮烟。\n念行秪意默，怀远岂言宣。\n委曲风波事，难爲尺素传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}